<% content_for :title, "Connect BearFace Ledger · Bearface" %>
<% content_for :description, "Connect or reconnect BearFace Ledger through Intuit OAuth." %>
<article class="standard-page">
  <header><p class="eyebrow">BearFace Ledger / Authorization</p><h1>Connect or reconnect</h1></header>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>BearFace Ledger connects to QuickBooks Online through Intuit's OAuth authorization process. An authorized BearFace representative chooses the company and approves the requested access on an Intuit-hosted screen.</p>
    <p>This app is only for QuickBooks Online companies owned or operated by BearFace Media, LLC. It is not available to customers or the public.</p>
    <p>The authorization link is provided inside BearFace Media's internal tools. If you are an authorized BearFace user and need help connecting or reconnecting, contact <a href="mailto:ben@bearface.io">ben@bearface.io</a>.</p>
    <div class="page-actions"><%= link_to "About BearFace Ledger", ledger_path, class: "button" %><%= link_to "Privacy policy", privacy_path %></div>
  </div>
</article>
